  "batch_edn": "{\"source\" \":agent/codex\" \"forms\" [[:db/add \"f1b16480-9c36-50f9-807e-8bef4c87f22a\" :answer/id #uuid \"f1b16480-9c36-50f9-807e-8bef4c87f22a\"] [:db/add \"f1b16480-9c36-50f9-807e-8bef4c87f22a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f1b16480-9c36-50f9-807e-8bef4c87f22a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"f1b16480-9c36-50f9-807e-8bef4c87f22a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9292dbeb-04c1-5a32-825d-48db9072d490\" :answer/id #uuid \"9292dbeb-04c1-5a32-825d-48db9072d490\"] [:db/add \"9292dbeb-04c1-5a32-825d-48db9072d490\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9292dbeb-04c1-5a32-825d-48db9072d490\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"9292dbeb-04c1-5a32-825d-48db9072d490\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\" :answer/id #uuid \"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\"] [:db/add \"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5cf0f831-44b4-5b73-a24c-dd7052978071\" :answer/id #uuid \"5cf0f831-44b4-5b73-a24c-dd7052978071\"] [:db/add \"5cf0f831-44b4-5b73-a24c-dd7052978071\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5cf0f831-44b4-5b73-a24c-dd7052978071\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{8}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"5cf0f831-44b4-5b73-a24c-dd7052978071\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"44e17a93-4b68-5f97-8d11-f86308e07ed7\" :answer/id #uuid \"44e17a93-4b68-5f97-8d11-f86308e07ed7\"] [:db/add \"44e17a93-4b68-5f97-8d11-f86308e07ed7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"44e17a93-4b68-5f97-8d11-f86308e07ed7\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"44e17a93-4b68-5f97-8d11-f86308e07ed7\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\"] [:db/add \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/choices \"f1b16480-9c36-50f9-807e-8bef4c87f22a\"] [:db/add \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/choices \"9292dbeb-04c1-5a32-825d-48db9072d490\"] [:db/add \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/choices \"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\"] [:db/add \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/choices \"5cf0f831-44b4-5b73-a24c-dd7052978071\"] [:db/add \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/choices \"44e17a93-4b68-5f97-8d11-f86308e07ed7\"] [:db/add \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/correct \"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\"] [:db/ensure \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\" :question/id #uuid \"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\"] [:db/add \"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{1}{4}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\" :question/answer-fields \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\"] [:db/ensure \"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\"] [:db/add \"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\" :answer/id #uuid \"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\"] [:db/add \"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0858e303-d45b-544b-a82f-2b47d25c2485\" :answer/id #uuid \"0858e303-d45b-544b-a82f-2b47d25c2485\"] [:db/add \"0858e303-d45b-544b-a82f-2b47d25c2485\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0858e303-d45b-544b-a82f-2b47d25c2485\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"0858e303-d45b-544b-a82f-2b47d25c2485\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"f9070c8e-98bb-537d-936c-b2fa536149cf\" :answer/id #uuid \"f9070c8e-98bb-537d-936c-b2fa536149cf\"] [:db/add \"f9070c8e-98bb-537d-936c-b2fa536149cf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f9070c8e-98bb-537d-936c-b2fa536149cf\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"f9070c8e-98bb-537d-936c-b2fa536149cf\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"76f48c92-d114-574e-949d-dfbbe632e2f7\" :answer/id #uuid \"76f48c92-d114-574e-949d-dfbbe632e2f7\"] [:db/add \"76f48c92-d114-574e-949d-dfbbe632e2f7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"76f48c92-d114-574e-949d-dfbbe632e2f7\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{8}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"76f48c92-d114-574e-949d-dfbbe632e2f7\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b6a37988-d4d9-5cc3-8d7e-644229205fc3\" :answer/id #uuid \"b6a37988-d4d9-5cc3-8d7e-644229205fc3\"] [:db/add \"b6a37988-d4d9-5cc3-8d7e-644229205fc3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b6a37988-d4d9-5cc3-8d7e-644229205fc3\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"b6a37988-d4d9-5cc3-8d7e-644229205fc3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\"] [:db/add \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/choices \"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\"] [:db/add \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/choices \"0858e303-d45b-544b-a82f-2b47d25c2485\"] [:db/add \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/choices \"f9070c8e-98bb-537d-936c-b2fa536149cf\"] [:db/add \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/choices \"76f48c92-d114-574e-949d-dfbbe632e2f7\"] [:db/add \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/choices \"b6a37988-d4d9-5cc3-8d7e-644229205fc3\"] [:db/add \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/correct \"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\"] [:db/ensure \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\" :question/id #uuid \"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\"] [:db/add \"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{3}{4}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\" :question/answer-fields \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\"] [:db/ensure \"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\"] [:db/add \"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\" :answer/id #uuid \"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\"] [:db/add \"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\" :answer/value \"\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7\" :answer/id #uuid \"f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7\"] [:db/add \"f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a\" :answer/id #uuid \"1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a\"] [:db/add \"1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5ae0933c-6d68-5428-8481-eb90fd459bb4\" :answer/id #uuid \"5ae0933c-6d68-5428-8481-eb90fd459bb4\"] [:db/add \"5ae0933c-6d68-5428-8481-eb90fd459bb4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5ae0933c-6d68-5428-8481-eb90fd459bb4\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"5ae0933c-6d68-5428-8481-eb90fd459bb4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d5aeb8b6-1c02-5992-a768-3a79b93fa593\" :answer/id #uuid \"d5aeb8b6-1c02-5992-a768-3a79b93fa593\"] [:db/add \"d5aeb8b6-1c02-5992-a768-3a79b93fa593\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d5aeb8b6-1c02-5992-a768-3a79b93fa593\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d5aeb8b6-1c02-5992-a768-3a79b93fa593\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\"] [:db/add \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/choices \"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\"] [:db/add \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/choices \"f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7\"] [:db/add \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/choices \"1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a\"] [:db/add \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/choices \"5ae0933c-6d68-5428-8481-eb90fd459bb4\"] [:db/add \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/choices \"d5aeb8b6-1c02-5992-a768-3a79b93fa593\"] [:db/add \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/correct \"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\"] [:db/ensure \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\" :question/id #uuid \"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\"] [:db/add \"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\" :question/answer-fields \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\"] [:db/ensure \"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\"] [:db/add \"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\" :answer/id #uuid \"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\"] [:db/add \"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\" :answer/value \"\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1e6cf756-f438-5468-b2ac-a1a776c0186b\" :answer/id #uuid \"1e6cf756-f438-5468-b2ac-a1a776c0186b\"] [:db/add \"1e6cf756-f438-5468-b2ac-a1a776c0186b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1e6cf756-f438-5468-b2ac-a1a776c0186b\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"1e6cf756-f438-5468-b2ac-a1a776c0186b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fe63a10d-a712-51b7-9c53-b15089294653\" :answer/id #uuid \"fe63a10d-a712-51b7-9c53-b15089294653\"] [:db/add \"fe63a10d-a712-51b7-9c53-b15089294653\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fe63a10d-a712-51b7-9c53-b15089294653\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"fe63a10d-a712-51b7-9c53-b15089294653\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"674b7b7c-6378-5abc-9d6c-fc9b19a1f412\" :answer/id #uuid \"674b7b7c-6378-5abc-9d6c-fc9b19a1f412\"] [:db/add \"674b7b7c-6378-5abc-9d6c-fc9b19a1f412\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"674b7b7c-6378-5abc-9d6c-fc9b19a1f412\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"674b7b7c-6378-5abc-9d6c-fc9b19a1f412\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"3e474cd7-7f34-5a64-bab1-3c3a2b0f75b8\" :answer/id #uuid \"3e474cd7-7f34-5a64-bab1-3c3a2b0f75b8\"] [:db/add \"3e474cd7-7f34-5a64-bab1-3c3a2b0f75b8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"3e474cd7-7f34-5a64-bab1-3c3a2b0f75b8\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"3e474cd7-7f34-5a64-bab1-3c3a2b0f75b8\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\"] [:db/add \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/choices \"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\"] [:db/add \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/choices \"1e6cf756-f438-5468-b2ac-a1a776c0186b\"] [:db/add \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/choices \"fe63a10d-a712-51b7-9c53-b15089294653\"] [:db/add \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/choices \"674b7b7c-6378-5abc-9d6c-fc9b19a1f412\"] [:db/add \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/choices \"3e474cd7-7f34-5a64-bab1-3c3a2b0f75b8\"] [:db/add \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/correct \"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\"] [:db/ensure \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\" :question/id #uuid \"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\"] [:db/add \"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\" :question/answer-fields \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\"] [:db/ensure \"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\"] [:db/add \"0cfa16d4-5631-5ba3-934a-4410fa770adc\" :answer/id #uuid \"0cfa16d4-5631-5ba3-934a-4410fa770adc\"] [:db/add \"0cfa16d4-5631-5ba3-934a-4410fa770adc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0cfa16d4-5631-5ba3-934a-4410fa770adc\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"0cfa16d4-5631-5ba3-934a-4410fa770adc\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"482a3659-7a22-5e4c-8b9a-2a39a7fc8886\" :answer/id #uuid \"482a3659-7a22-5e4c-8b9a-2a39a7fc8886\"] [:db/add \"482a3659-7a22-5e4c-8b9a-2a39a7fc8886\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"482a3659-7a22-5e4c-8b9a-2a39a7fc8886\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"482a3659-7a22-5e4c-8b9a-2a39a7fc8886\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fbcd31a5-5b5e-57da-8f89-9460b07dd7d5\" :answer/id #uuid \"fbcd31a5-5b5e-57da-8f89-9460b07dd7d5\"] [:db/add \"fbcd31a5-5b5e-57da-8f89-9460b07dd7d5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fbcd31a5-5b5e-57da-8f89-9460b07dd7d5\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"fbcd31a5-5b5e-57da-8f89-9460b07dd7d5\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"f16dfa66-8c67-52e6-a66a-7a95a8924434\" :answer/id #uuid \"f16dfa66-8c67-52e6-a66a-7a95a8924434\"] [:db/add \"f16dfa66-8c67-52e6-a66a-7a95a8924434\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f16dfa66-8c67-52e6-a66a-7a95a8924434\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{12}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"f16dfa66-8c67-52e6-a66a-7a95a8924434\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\" :answer/id #uuid \"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\"] [:db/add \"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\"] [:db/add \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/choices \"0cfa16d4-5631-5ba3-934a-4410fa770adc\"] [:db/add \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/choices \"482a3659-7a22-5e4c-8b9a-2a39a7fc8886\"] [:db/add \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/choices \"fbcd31a5-5b5e-57da-8f89-9460b07dd7d5\"] [:db/add \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/choices \"f16dfa66-8c67-52e6-a66a-7a95a8924434\"] [:db/add \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/choices \"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\"] [:db/add \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/correct \"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\"] [:db/ensure \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\" :question/id #uuid \"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\"] [:db/add \"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{4}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\" :question/answer-fields \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\"] [:db/ensure \"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\"] [:db/add \"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\" :answer/id #uuid \"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\"] [:db/add \"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5562ca8a-35d2-531a-8583-831dbb8b4782\" :answer/id #uuid \"5562ca8a-35d2-531a-8583-831dbb8b4782\"] [:db/add \"5562ca8a-35d2-531a-8583-831dbb8b4782\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5562ca8a-35d2-531a-8583-831dbb8b4782\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"5562ca8a-35d2-531a-8583-831dbb8b4782\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"49bceb23-39fc-5501-8de2-bae684444332\" :answer/id #uuid \"49bceb23-39fc-5501-8de2-bae684444332\"] [:db/add \"49bceb23-39fc-5501-8de2-bae684444332\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"49bceb23-39fc-5501-8de2-bae684444332\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"49bceb23-39fc-5501-8de2-bae684444332\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5452d27c-098b-5d42-9957-4a9b29ed171c\" :answer/id #uuid \"5452d27c-098b-5d42-9957-4a9b29ed171c\"] [:db/add \"5452d27c-098b-5d42-9957-4a9b29ed171c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5452d27c-098b-5d42-9957-4a9b29ed171c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"5452d27c-098b-5d42-9957-4a9b29ed171c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"f804bd82-51d1-5855-8258-16ab61cd35c4\" :answer/id #uuid \"f804bd82-51d1-5855-8258-16ab61cd35c4\"] [:db/add \"f804bd82-51d1-5855-8258-16ab61cd35c4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f804bd82-51d1-5855-8258-16ab61cd35c4\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"f804bd82-51d1-5855-8258-16ab61cd35c4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\"] [:db/add \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/choices \"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\"] [:db/add \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/choices \"5562ca8a-35d2-531a-8583-831dbb8b4782\"] [:db/add \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/choices \"49bceb23-39fc-5501-8de2-bae684444332\"] [:db/add \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/choices \"5452d27c-098b-5d42-9957-4a9b29ed171c\"] [:db/add \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/choices \"f804bd82-51d1-5855-8258-16ab61cd35c4\"] [:db/add \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/correct \"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\"] [:db/ensure \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\" :question/id #uuid \"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\"] [:db/add \"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{2}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\" :question/answer-fields \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\"] [:db/ensure \"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\"] [:db/add \"d0aaf219-cc1f-5535-8fd4-5d943078d5b9\" :answer/id #uuid \"d0aaf219-cc1f-5535-8fd4-5d943078d5b9\"] [:db/add \"d0aaf219-cc1f-5535-8fd4-5d943078d5b9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d0aaf219-cc1f-5535-8fd4-5d943078d5b9\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d0aaf219-cc1f-5535-8fd4-5d943078d5b9\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"23f84d1d-f503-59bc-99f2-653086abbd50\" :answer/id #uuid \"23f84d1d-f503-59bc-99f2-653086abbd50\"] [:db/add \"23f84d1d-f503-59bc-99f2-653086abbd50\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"23f84d1d-f503-59bc-99f2-653086abbd50\" :answer/value \"\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"23f84d1d-f503-59bc-99f2-653086abbd50\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5616b423-4249-5fab-90b8-d2c73b2c6e24\" :answer/id #uuid \"5616b423-4249-5fab-90b8-d2c73b2c6e24\"] [:db/add \"5616b423-4249-5fab-90b8-d2c73b2c6e24\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5616b423-4249-5fab-90b8-d2c73b2c6e24\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"5616b423-4249-5fab-90b8-d2c73b2c6e24\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7f83b197-1529-5e99-b04a-707f0a67cb4a\" :answer/id #uuid \"7f83b197-1529-5e99-b04a-707f0a67cb4a\"] [:db/add \"7f83b197-1529-5e99-b04a-707f0a67cb4a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7f83b197-1529-5e99-b04a-707f0a67cb4a\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"7f83b197-1529-5e99-b04a-707f0a67cb4a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\" :answer/id #uuid \"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\"] [:db/add \"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\"] [:db/add \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/choices \"d0aaf219-cc1f-5535-8fd4-5d943078d5b9\"] [:db/add \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/choices \"23f84d1d-f503-59bc-99f2-653086abbd50\"] [:db/add \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/choices \"5616b423-4249-5fab-90b8-d2c73b2c6e24\"] [:db/add \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/choices \"7f83b197-1529-5e99-b04a-707f0a67cb4a\"] [:db/add \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/choices \"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\"] [:db/add \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/correct \"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\"] [:db/ensure \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\" :question/id #uuid \"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\"] [:db/add \"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=2$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\" :question/answer-fields \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\"] [:db/ensure \"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\"] [:db/add \"21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3\" :answer/id #uuid \"21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3\"] [:db/add \"21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23\" :answer/id #uuid \"94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23\"] [:db/add \"94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc\" :answer/id #uuid \"88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc\"] [:db/add \"88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{10}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a2644a79-8d95-5309-ba22-62887c805494\" :answer/id #uuid \"a2644a79-8d95-5309-ba22-62887c805494\"] [:db/add \"a2644a79-8d95-5309-ba22-62887c805494\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"a2644a79-8d95-5309-ba22-62887c805494\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"a2644a79-8d95-5309-ba22-62887c805494\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\" :answer/id #uuid \"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\"] [:db/add \"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\"] [:db/add \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/choices \"21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3\"] [:db/add \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/choices \"94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23\"] [:db/add \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/choices \"88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc\"] [:db/add \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/choices \"a2644a79-8d95-5309-ba22-62887c805494\"] [:db/add \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/choices \"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\"] [:db/add \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/correct \"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\"] [:db/ensure \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\" :question/id #uuid \"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\"] [:db/add \"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{1}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\" :question/answer-fields \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\"] [:db/ensure \"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\"] [:db/add \"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\" :answer/id #uuid \"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\"] [:db/add \"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346\" :answer/id #uuid \"b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346\"] [:db/add \"b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5fe273df-1eda-5c72-9f41-fe06a6624c7a\" :answer/id #uuid \"5fe273df-1eda-5c72-9f41-fe06a6624c7a\"] [:db/add \"5fe273df-1eda-5c72-9f41-fe06a6624c7a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5fe273df-1eda-5c72-9f41-fe06a6624c7a\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"5fe273df-1eda-5c72-9f41-fe06a6624c7a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5f66405d-f8fd-5913-9c55-7a2a881e0f3c\" :answer/id #uuid \"5f66405d-f8fd-5913-9c55-7a2a881e0f3c\"] [:db/add \"5f66405d-f8fd-5913-9c55-7a2a881e0f3c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5f66405d-f8fd-5913-9c55-7a2a881e0f3c\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"5f66405d-f8fd-5913-9c55-7a2a881e0f3c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bb86e264-e9b1-5a13-bdad-5916b0ae8452\" :answer/id #uuid \"bb86e264-e9b1-5a13-bdad-5916b0ae8452\"] [:db/add \"bb86e264-e9b1-5a13-bdad-5916b0ae8452\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bb86e264-e9b1-5a13-bdad-5916b0ae8452\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"bb86e264-e9b1-5a13-bdad-5916b0ae8452\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\"] [:db/add \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/choices \"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\"] [:db/add \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/choices \"b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346\"] [:db/add \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/choices \"5fe273df-1eda-5c72-9f41-fe06a6624c7a\"] [:db/add \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/choices \"5f66405d-f8fd-5913-9c55-7a2a881e0f3c\"] [:db/add \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/choices \"bb86e264-e9b1-5a13-bdad-5916b0ae8452\"] [:db/add \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/correct \"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\"] [:db/ensure \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\" :question/id #uuid \"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\"] [:db/add \"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\" :question/answer-fields \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\"] [:db/ensure \"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\"] [:db/add \"35a499f0-74ec-58b5-9289-81cd6de2ed8b\" :answer/id #uuid \"35a499f0-74ec-58b5-9289-81cd6de2ed8b\"] [:db/add \"35a499f0-74ec-58b5-9289-81cd6de2ed8b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"35a499f0-74ec-58b5-9289-81cd6de2ed8b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"35a499f0-74ec-58b5-9289-81cd6de2ed8b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5b37ef5c-0a54-50f9-8929-55db42f1cf0b\" :answer/id #uuid \"5b37ef5c-0a54-50f9-8929-55db42f1cf0b\"] [:db/add \"5b37ef5c-0a54-50f9-8929-55db42f1cf0b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5b37ef5c-0a54-50f9-8929-55db42f1cf0b\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"5b37ef5c-0a54-50f9-8929-55db42f1cf0b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"06b6f683-62bf-5a71-a0bf-5f5d78b13621\" :answer/id #uuid \"06b6f683-62bf-5a71-a0bf-5f5d78b13621\"] [:db/add \"06b6f683-62bf-5a71-a0bf-5f5d78b13621\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"06b6f683-62bf-5a71-a0bf-5f5d78b13621\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"06b6f683-62bf-5a71-a0bf-5f5d78b13621\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\" :answer/id #uuid \"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\"] [:db/add \"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fb47295e-82b8-5ceb-8a04-f8c683d541af\" :answer/id #uuid \"fb47295e-82b8-5ceb-8a04-f8c683d541af\"] [:db/add \"fb47295e-82b8-5ceb-8a04-f8c683d541af\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fb47295e-82b8-5ceb-8a04-f8c683d541af\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"fb47295e-82b8-5ceb-8a04-f8c683d541af\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\"] [:db/add \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/choices \"35a499f0-74ec-58b5-9289-81cd6de2ed8b\"] [:db/add \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/choices \"5b37ef5c-0a54-50f9-8929-55db42f1cf0b\"] [:db/add \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/choices \"06b6f683-62bf-5a71-a0bf-5f5d78b13621\"] [:db/add \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/choices \"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\"] [:db/add \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/choices \"fb47295e-82b8-5ceb-8a04-f8c683d541af\"] [:db/add \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/correct \"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\"] [:db/ensure \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\" :question/id #uuid \"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\"] [:db/add \"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{4}{3}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\" :question/answer-fields \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\"] [:db/ensure \"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\"] [:db/add \"5ddf65e8-eb2f-53be-ae83-c354ca054f8d\" :answer/id #uuid \"5ddf65e8-eb2f-53be-ae83-c354ca054f8d\"] [:db/add \"5ddf65e8-eb2f-53be-ae83-c354ca054f8d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5ddf65e8-eb2f-53be-ae83-c354ca054f8d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"5ddf65e8-eb2f-53be-ae83-c354ca054f8d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"97ad9c8e-c2ce-5cb3-8b19-7f98b2f70e4d\" :answer/id #uuid \"97ad9c8e-c2ce-5cb3-8b19-7f98b2f70e4d\"] [:db/add \"97ad9c8e-c2ce-5cb3-8b19-7f98b2f70e4d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"97ad9c8e-c2ce-5cb3-8b19-7f98b2f70e4d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"97ad9c8e-c2ce-5cb3-8b19-7f98b2f70e4d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c4ad03ca-167e-50ec-870b-d6819e0e5125\" :answer/id #uuid \"c4ad03ca-167e-50ec-870b-d6819e0e5125\"] [:db/add \"c4ad03ca-167e-50ec-870b-d6819e0e5125\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c4ad03ca-167e-50ec-870b-d6819e0e5125\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"c4ad03ca-167e-50ec-870b-d6819e0e5125\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6967a641-edd3-5a74-b591-85d1ab4da76f\" :answer/id #uuid \"6967a641-edd3-5a74-b591-85d1ab4da76f\"] [:db/add \"6967a641-edd3-5a74-b591-85d1ab4da76f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6967a641-edd3-5a74-b591-85d1ab4da76f\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"6967a641-edd3-5a74-b591-85d1ab4da76f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\" :answer/id #uuid \"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\"] [:db/add \"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\"] [:db/add \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/choices \"5ddf65e8-eb2f-53be-ae83-c354ca054f8d\"] [:db/add \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/choices \"97ad9c8e-c2ce-5cb3-8b19-7f98b2f70e4d\"] [:db/add \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/choices \"c4ad03ca-167e-50ec-870b-d6819e0e5125\"] [:db/add \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/choices \"6967a641-edd3-5a74-b591-85d1ab4da76f\"] [:db/add \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/choices \"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\"] [:db/add \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/correct \"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\"] [:db/ensure \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\" :question/id #uuid \"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\"] [:db/add \"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{4}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\" :question/answer-fields \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\"] [:db/ensure \"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\"] [:db/add \"b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57\" :answer/id #uuid \"b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57\"] [:db/add \"b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f\" :answer/id #uuid \"8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f\"] [:db/add \"8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"202b6e2e-f98c-5e7c-9e3a-d3c48dd60d36\" :answer/id #uuid \"202b6e2e-f98c-5e7c-9e3a-d3c48dd60d36\"] [:db/add \"202b6e2e-f98c-5e7c-9e3a-d3c48dd60d36\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"202b6e2e-f98c-5e7c-9e3a-d3c48dd60d36\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"202b6e2e-f98c-5e7c-9e3a-d3c48dd60d36\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\" :answer/id #uuid \"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\"] [:db/add \"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"36f70c88-0ef6-5ca6-92e7-d158d89d5f26\" :answer/id #uuid \"36f70c88-0ef6-5ca6-92e7-d158d89d5f26\"] [:db/add \"36f70c88-0ef6-5ca6-92e7-d158d89d5f26\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"36f70c88-0ef6-5ca6-92e7-d158d89d5f26\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"36f70c88-0ef6-5ca6-92e7-d158d89d5f26\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\"] [:db/add \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/choices \"b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57\"] [:db/add \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/choices \"8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f\"] [:db/add \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/choices \"202b6e2e-f98c-5e7c-9e3a-d3c48dd60d36\"] [:db/add \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/choices \"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\"] [:db/add \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/choices \"36f70c88-0ef6-5ca6-92e7-d158d89d5f26\"] [:db/add \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/correct \"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\"] [:db/ensure \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\" :question/id #uuid \"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\"] [:db/add \"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\" :question/answer-fields \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\"] [:db/ensure \"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\"] [:db/add \"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\" :answer/id #uuid \"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\"] [:db/add \"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7aa9a9e2-e7ca-568f-8ff8-ed126c211b80\" :answer/id #uuid \"7aa9a9e2-e7ca-568f-8ff8-ed126c211b80\"] [:db/add \"7aa9a9e2-e7ca-568f-8ff8-ed126c211b80\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7aa9a9e2-e7ca-568f-8ff8-ed126c211b80\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"7aa9a9e2-e7ca-568f-8ff8-ed126c211b80\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"48e1bae3-16e7-5573-8ec1-32d48bb60bf6\" :answer/id #uuid \"48e1bae3-16e7-5573-8ec1-32d48bb60bf6\"] [:db/add \"48e1bae3-16e7-5573-8ec1-32d48bb60bf6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"48e1bae3-16e7-5573-8ec1-32d48bb60bf6\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"48e1bae3-16e7-5573-8ec1-32d48bb60bf6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a256a3dc-a3b6-5a7c-b4c9-2b41b4a45257\" :answer/id #uuid \"a256a3dc-a3b6-5a7c-b4c9-2b41b4a45257\"] [:db/add \"a256a3dc-a3b6-5a7c-b4c9-2b41b4a45257\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"a256a3dc-a3b6-5a7c-b4c9-2b41b4a45257\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"a256a3dc-a3b6-5a7c-b4c9-2b41b4a45257\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ce92345c-fccd-5f71-80c8-5f31cd57e8b6\" :answer/id #uuid \"ce92345c-fccd-5f71-80c8-5f31cd57e8b6\"] [:db/add \"ce92345c-fccd-5f71-80c8-5f31cd57e8b6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ce92345c-fccd-5f71-80c8-5f31cd57e8b6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ce92345c-fccd-5f71-80c8-5f31cd57e8b6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\"] [:db/add \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/choices \"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\"] [:db/add \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/choices \"7aa9a9e2-e7ca-568f-8ff8-ed126c211b80\"] [:db/add \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/choices \"48e1bae3-16e7-5573-8ec1-32d48bb60bf6\"] [:db/add \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/choices \"a256a3dc-a3b6-5a7c-b4c9-2b41b4a45257\"] [:db/add \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/choices \"ce92345c-fccd-5f71-80c8-5f31cd57e8b6\"] [:db/add \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/correct \"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\"] [:db/ensure \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\" :question/id #uuid \"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\"] [:db/add \"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{1}{2}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\" :question/answer-fields \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\"] [:db/ensure \"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\"] [:db/add \"e923fc12-9cee-5e6f-b8ea-abccf7941fef\" :answer/id #uuid \"e923fc12-9cee-5e6f-b8ea-abccf7941fef\"] [:db/add \"e923fc12-9cee-5e6f-b8ea-abccf7941fef\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e923fc12-9cee-5e6f-b8ea-abccf7941fef\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"e923fc12-9cee-5e6f-b8ea-abccf7941fef\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2c2e2a1a-3cd6-5c4c-aebd-51d8adce6fcd\" :answer/id #uuid \"2c2e2a1a-3cd6-5c4c-aebd-51d8adce6fcd\"] [:db/add \"2c2e2a1a-3cd6-5c4c-aebd-51d8adce6fcd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2c2e2a1a-3cd6-5c4c-aebd-51d8adce6fcd\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"2c2e2a1a-3cd6-5c4c-aebd-51d8adce6fcd\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e740253a-8298-550f-879e-caa0ff00a294\" :answer/id #uuid \"e740253a-8298-550f-879e-caa0ff00a294\"] [:db/add \"e740253a-8298-550f-879e-caa0ff00a294\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e740253a-8298-550f-879e-caa0ff00a294\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"e740253a-8298-550f-879e-caa0ff00a294\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ae2a61db-1b69-5e72-b058-0c91779f9cde\" :answer/id #uuid \"ae2a61db-1b69-5e72-b058-0c91779f9cde\"] [:db/add \"ae2a61db-1b69-5e72-b058-0c91779f9cde\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ae2a61db-1b69-5e72-b058-0c91779f9cde\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ae2a61db-1b69-5e72-b058-0c91779f9cde\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ae144fb9-7aa6-577c-afcc-9db6f4da3b89\" :answer/id #uuid \"ae144fb9-7aa6-577c-afcc-9db6f4da3b89\"] [:db/add \"ae144fb9-7aa6-577c-afcc-9db6f4da3b89\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ae144fb9-7aa6-577c-afcc-9db6f4da3b89\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ae144fb9-7aa6-577c-afcc-9db6f4da3b89\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\"] [:db/add \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\" :answer-field/choices \"e923fc12-9cee-5e6f-b8ea-abccf7941fef\"] [:db/add \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\" :answer-field/choices \"2c2e2a1a-3cd6-5c4c-aebd-51d8adce6fcd\"] [:db/add \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\" :answer-field/choices \"e740253a-8298-550f-879e-caa0ff00a294\"] [:db/add \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\" :answer-field/choices \"ae2a61db-1b69-5e72-b058-0c91779f9cde\"] [:db/add \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\" :answer-field/choices \"ae144fb9-7aa6-577c-afcc-9db6f4da3b89\"] [:db/add \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\" :answer-field/correct \"e923fc12-9cee-5e6f-b8ea-abccf7941fef\"] [:db/ensure \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b\" :question/id #uuid \"f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b\"] [:db/add \"f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{3}{4}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b\" :question/answer-fields \"b3e9108b-9b5d-5ac8-beba-3e637f2e5c1b\"] [:db/ensure \"f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"f054d58c-180c-591b-ad06-4546c86b706b\"] [:db/add \"22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9\" :answer/id #uuid \"22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9\"] [:db/add \"22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e\" :answer/id #uuid \"40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e\"] [:db/add \"40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4c5be87a-280e-5e27-94d4-760eb3e4efab\" :answer/id #uuid \"4c5be87a-280e-5e27-94d4-760eb3e4efab\"] [:db/add \"4c5be87a-280e-5e27-94d4-760eb3e4efab\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4c5be87a-280e-5e27-94d4-760eb3e4efab\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"4c5be87a-280e-5e27-94d4-760eb3e4efab\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ba785ef5-5dfe-56a4-9972-ec65ecf92308\" :answer/id #uuid \"ba785ef5-5dfe-56a4-9972-ec65ecf92308\"] [:db/add \"ba785ef5-5dfe-56a4-9972-ec65ecf92308\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ba785ef5-5dfe-56a4-9972-ec65ecf92308\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ba785ef5-5dfe-56a4-9972-ec65ecf92308\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"61ea967d-3662-5112-a401-c106190ec2d8\" :answer/id #uuid \"61ea967d-3662-5112-a401-c106190ec2d8\"] [:db/add \"61ea967d-3662-5112-a401-c106190ec2d8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"61ea967d-3662-5112-a401-c106190ec2d8\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"61ea967d-3662-5112-a401-c106190ec2d8\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\"] [:db/add \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\" :answer-field/choices \"22234917-661d-55e6-bf15-1539dc6f1ca9\"] [:db/add \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\" :answer-field/choices \"40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e\"] [:db/add \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\" :answer-field/choices \"4c5be87a-280e-5e27-94d4-760eb3e4efab\"] [:db/add \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\" :answer-field/choices \"ba785ef5-5dfe-56a4-9972-ec65ecf92308\"] [:db/add \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\" :answer-field/choices \"61ea967d-3662-5112-a401-c106190ec2d8\"] [:db/add \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\" :answer-field/correct \"40598f69-d38c-580a-ac76-25dd1df1772e\"] [:db/ensure \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"f0669784-ec1f-5ea5-8858-d62b3e3c7a46\" :question/id #uuid \"f0669784-ec1f-5ea5-8858-d62b3e3c7a46\"] [:db/add \"f0669784-ec1f-5ea5-8858-d62b3e3c7a46\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"f0669784-ec1f-5ea5-8858-d62b3e3c7a46\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{2}{3}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"f0669784-ec1f-5ea5-8858-d62b3e3c7a46\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"f0669784-ec1f-5ea5-8858-d62b3e3c7a46\" :question/answer-fields \"d20f1c0e-2f95-59e8-aaf0-a406d464023a\"] [:db/ensure \"f0669784-ec1f-5ea5-8858-d62b3e3c7a46\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"f0669784-ec1f-5ea5-8858-d62b3e3c7a46\"] [:db/add \"ed85456d-5678-5a66-b5ec-36790d6f87d7\" :answer/id #uuid \"ed85456d-5678-5a66-b5ec-36790d6f87d7\"] [:db/add \"ed85456d-5678-5a66-b5ec-36790d6f87d7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ed85456d-5678-5a66-b5ec-36790d6f87d7\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ed85456d-5678-5a66-b5ec-36790d6f87d7\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ac964986-401f-564c-b1a5-b2b673875903\" :answer/id #uuid \"ac964986-401f-564c-b1a5-b2b673875903\"] [:db/add \"ac964986-401f-564c-b1a5-b2b673875903\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ac964986-401f-564c-b1a5-b2b673875903\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ac964986-401f-564c-b1a5-b2b673875903\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"821b7127-b355-5427-a9ef-1b1dac049cab\" :answer/id #uuid \"821b7127-b355-5427-a9ef-1b1dac049cab\"] [:db/add \"821b7127-b355-5427-a9ef-1b1dac049cab\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"821b7127-b355-5427-a9ef-1b1dac049cab\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"821b7127-b355-5427-a9ef-1b1dac049cab\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"696e45a1-fd5f-57d8-9430-112536a04978\" :answer/id #uuid \"696e45a1-fd5f-57d8-9430-112536a04978\"] [:db/add \"696e45a1-fd5f-57d8-9430-112536a04978\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"696e45a1-fd5f-57d8-9430-112536a04978\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"696e45a1-fd5f-57d8-9430-112536a04978\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fd8e0c30-f35d-5003-a4dd-9448e64631ad\" :answer/id #uuid \"fd8e0c30-f35d-5003-a4dd-9448e64631ad\"] [:db/add \"fd8e0c30-f35d-5003-a4dd-9448e64631ad\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fd8e0c30-f35d-5003-a4dd-9448e64631ad\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"fd8e0c30-f35d-5003-a4dd-9448e64631ad\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\"] [:db/add \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\" :answer-field/choices \"ed85456d-5678-5a66-b5ec-36790d6f87d7\"] [:db/add \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\" :answer-field/choices \"ac964986-401f-564c-b1a5-b2b673875903\"] [:db/add \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\" :answer-field/choices \"821b7127-b355-5427-a9ef-1b1dac049cab\"] [:db/add \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\" :answer-field/choices \"696e45a1-fd5f-57d8-9430-112536a04978\"] [:db/add \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\" :answer-field/choices \"fd8e0c30-f35d-5003-a4dd-9448e64631ad\"] [:db/add \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\" :answer-field/correct \"ac964986-401f-564c-b1a5-b2b673875903\"] [:db/ensure \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa\" :question/id #uuid \"f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa\"] [:db/add \"f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{3}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa\" :question/answer-fields \"4d199d5d-0de4-57e8-9e25-af029988c010\"] [:db/ensure \"f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"f1b7fa87-c039-55a3-9a9e-c5ff3a8013fa\"] [:db/add \"70e8de43-8fdf-5b62-a70c-558d5960567c\" :answer/id #uuid \"70e8de43-8fdf-5b62-a70c-558d5960567c\"] [:db/add \"70e8de43-8fdf-5b62-a70c-558d5960567c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"70e8de43-8fdf-5b62-a70c-558d5960567c\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"70e8de43-8fdf-5b62-a70c-558d5960567c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fd7d10e5-ea3f-530b-b2ab-a76c1cfd107c\" :answer/id #uuid \"fd7d10e5-ea3f-530b-b2ab-a76c1cfd107c\"] [:db/add \"fd7d10e5-ea3f-530b-b2ab-a76c1cfd107c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fd7d10e5-ea3f-530b-b2ab-a76c1cfd107c\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"fd7d10e5-ea3f-530b-b2ab-a76c1cfd107c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e\" :answer/id #uuid \"423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e\"] [:db/add \"423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6b5c2a97-06ea-5deb-9a32-167c5fcf621d\" :answer/id #uuid \"6b5c2a97-06ea-5deb-9a32-167c5fcf621d\"] [:db/add \"6b5c2a97-06ea-5deb-9a32-167c5fcf621d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6b5c2a97-06ea-5deb-9a32-167c5fcf621d\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"6b5c2a97-06ea-5deb-9a32-167c5fcf621d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4256fa28-48a7-5d50-a4f2-714dd6256373\" :answer/id #uuid \"4256fa28-48a7-5d50-a4f2-714dd6256373\"] [:db/add \"4256fa28-48a7-5d50-a4f2-714dd6256373\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4256fa28-48a7-5d50-a4f2-714dd6256373\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"4256fa28-48a7-5d50-a4f2-714dd6256373\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\"] [:db/add \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\" :answer-field/choices \"70e8de43-8fdf-5b62-a70c-558d5960567c\"] [:db/add \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\" :answer-field/choices \"fd7d10e5-ea3f-530b-b2ab-a76c1cfd107c\"] [:db/add \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\" :answer-field/choices \"423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e\"] [:db/add \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\" :answer-field/choices \"6b5c2a97-06ea-5deb-9a32-167c5fcf621d\"] [:db/add \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\" :answer-field/choices \"4256fa28-48a7-5d50-a4f2-714dd6256373\"] [:db/add \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\" :answer-field/correct \"423cac0f-e0d4-5c82-a36c-3fd77bc79d7e\"] [:db/ensure \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943\" :question/id #uuid \"bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943\"] [:db/add \"bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $6\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=2$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943\" :question/answer-fields \"13e879be-7fd7-5b58-aac6-1b0f6a224e96\"] [:db/ensure \"bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"bfa0ba88-cd1a-5014-a502-27b6d9f6c943\"] [:db/add \"7919f065-684f-5162-84c1-326bee6ae511\" :answer/id #uuid \"7919f065-684f-5162-84c1-326bee6ae511\"] [:db/add \"7919f065-684f-5162-84c1-326bee6ae511\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7919f065-684f-5162-84c1-326bee6ae511\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"7919f065-684f-5162-84c1-326bee6ae511\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"876f62f1-9b04-5c3d-8733-6432cf43bea5\" :answer/id #uuid \"876f62f1-9b04-5c3d-8733-6432cf43bea5\"] [:db/add \"876f62f1-9b04-5c3d-8733-6432cf43bea5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"876f62f1-9b04-5c3d-8733-6432cf43bea5\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"876f62f1-9b04-5c3d-8733-6432cf43bea5\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b7a75978-9c9e-57e7-9d29-c8315015fdcd\" :answer/id #uuid \"b7a75978-9c9e-57e7-9d29-c8315015fdcd\"] [:db/add \"b7a75978-9c9e-57e7-9d29-c8315015fdcd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b7a75978-9c9e-57e7-9d29-c8315015fdcd\" :answer/value \"-3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"b7a75978-9c9e-57e7-9d29-c8315015fdcd\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0af9ecf0-ad27-5c54-bcc2-d7c243cc178e\" :answer/id #uuid \"0af9ecf0-ad27-5c54-bcc2-d7c243cc178e\"] [:db/add \"0af9ecf0-ad27-5c54-bcc2-d7c243cc178e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0af9ecf0-ad27-5c54-bcc2-d7c243cc178e\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"0af9ecf0-ad27-5c54-bcc2-d7c243cc178e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"91a06352-fe59-5083-972f-300fef7dbc84\" :answer/id #uuid \"91a06352-fe59-5083-972f-300fef7dbc84\"] [:db/add \"91a06352-fe59-5083-972f-300fef7dbc84\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"91a06352-fe59-5083-972f-300fef7dbc84\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"91a06352-fe59-5083-972f-300fef7dbc84\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\"] [:db/add \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\" :answer-field/choices \"7919f065-684f-5162-84c1-326bee6ae511\"] [:db/add \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\" :answer-field/choices \"876f62f1-9b04-5c3d-8733-6432cf43bea5\"] [:db/add \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\" :answer-field/choices \"b7a75978-9c9e-57e7-9d29-c8315015fdcd\"] [:db/add \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\" :answer-field/choices \"0af9ecf0-ad27-5c54-bcc2-d7c243cc178e\"] [:db/add \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\" :answer-field/choices \"91a06352-fe59-5083-972f-300fef7dbc84\"] [:db/add \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\" :answer-field/correct \"876f62f1-9b04-5c3d-8733-6432cf43bea5\"] [:db/ensure \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"2c09025a-e36a-5f98-8a3a-ecae05ef8ee0\" :question/id #uuid \"2c09025a-e36a-5f98-8a3a-ecae05ef8ee0\"] [:db/add \"2c09025a-e36a-5f98-8a3a-ecae05ef8ee0\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"2c09025a-e36a-5f98-8a3a-ecae05ef8ee0\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $4>0$, $|u|=4|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/4$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $12\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=3$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"2c09025a-e36a-5f98-8a3a-ecae05ef8ee0\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"2c09025a-e36a-5f98-8a3a-ecae05ef8ee0\" :question/answer-fields \"2a5b0386-1523-52c2-8e5e-63a3e9478c59\"] [:db/ensure \"2c09025a-e36a-5f98-8a3a-ecae05ef8ee0\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"2c09025a-e36a-5f98-8a3a-ecae05ef8ee0\"] [:db/add \"ab0bce01-5c37-5eef-acfa-6c3ad9b30c48\" :answer/id #uuid \"ab0bce01-5c37-5eef-acfa-6c3ad9b30c48\"] [:db/add \"ab0bce01-5c37-5eef-acfa-6c3ad9b30c48\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ab0bce01-5c37-5eef-acfa-6c3ad9b30c48\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ab0bce01-5c37-5eef-acfa-6c3ad9b30c48\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"23088978-2ce1-5552-a18e-32ab1b227133\" :answer/id #uuid \"23088978-2ce1-5552-a18e-32ab1b227133\"] [:db/add \"23088978-2ce1-5552-a18e-32ab1b227133\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"23088978-2ce1-5552-a18e-32ab1b227133\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"23088978-2ce1-5552-a18e-32ab1b227133\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ecfeba93-2ccd-5d4f-bebf-35393b80e906\" :answer/id #uuid \"ecfeba93-2ccd-5d4f-bebf-35393b80e906\"] [:db/add \"ecfeba93-2ccd-5d4f-bebf-35393b80e906\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ecfeba93-2ccd-5d4f-bebf-35393b80e906\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ecfeba93-2ccd-5d4f-bebf-35393b80e906\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4d0cd5f7-073d-5d5a-b881-bdaaeaaf2053\" :answer/id #uuid \"4d0cd5f7-073d-5d5a-b881-bdaaeaaf2053\"] [:db/add \"4d0cd5f7-073d-5d5a-b881-bdaaeaaf2053\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4d0cd5f7-073d-5d5a-b881-bdaaeaaf2053\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"4d0cd5f7-073d-5d5a-b881-bdaaeaaf2053\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2867c5f9-486e-5412-9dc6-3f424ccb2821\" :answer/id #uuid \"2867c5f9-486e-5412-9dc6-3f424ccb2821\"] [:db/add \"2867c5f9-486e-5412-9dc6-3f424ccb2821\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2867c5f9-486e-5412-9dc6-3f424ccb2821\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"2867c5f9-486e-5412-9dc6-3f424ccb2821\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\"] [:db/add \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\" :answer-field/choices \"ab0bce01-5c37-5eef-acfa-6c3ad9b30c48\"] [:db/add \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\" :answer-field/choices \"23088978-2ce1-5552-a18e-32ab1b227133\"] [:db/add \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\" :answer-field/choices \"ecfeba93-2ccd-5d4f-bebf-35393b80e906\"] [:db/add \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\" :answer-field/choices \"4d0cd5f7-073d-5d5a-b881-bdaaeaaf2053\"] [:db/add \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\" :answer-field/choices \"2867c5f9-486e-5412-9dc6-3f424ccb2821\"] [:db/add \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\" :answer-field/correct \"4d0cd5f7-073d-5d5a-b881-bdaaeaaf2053\"] [:db/ensure \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"e458c6a7-d57b-5820-90ef-f845411de6d9\" :question/id #uuid \"e458c6a7-d57b-5820-90ef-f845411de6d9\"] [:db/add \"e458c6a7-d57b-5820-90ef-f845411de6d9\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"e458c6a7-d57b-5820-90ef-f845411de6d9\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $5>0$, $|u|=5|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/5$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $10\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=2$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"e458c6a7-d57b-5820-90ef-f845411de6d9\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"e458c6a7-d57b-5820-90ef-f845411de6d9\" :question/answer-fields \"37c1b041-26d8-547b-afc4-f26c60dc9ce0\"] [:db/ensure \"e458c6a7-d57b-5820-90ef-f845411de6d9\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"e458c6a7-d57b-5820-90ef-f845411de6d9\"] [:db/add \"17e8cc9b-2090-546f-b5f6-63612df70c02\" :answer/id #uuid \"17e8cc9b-2090-546f-b5f6-63612df70c02\"] [:db/add \"17e8cc9b-2090-546f-b5f6-63612df70c02\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"17e8cc9b-2090-546f-b5f6-63612df70c02\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"17e8cc9b-2090-546f-b5f6-63612df70c02\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"dc24f586-1089-577f-8c0e-7f39b8c84c5c\" :answer/id #uuid \"dc24f586-1089-577f-8c0e-7f39b8c84c5c\"] [:db/add \"dc24f586-1089-577f-8c0e-7f39b8c84c5c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"dc24f586-1089-577f-8c0e-7f39b8c84c5c\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"dc24f586-1089-577f-8c0e-7f39b8c84c5c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c9c5e16a-fe3c-5a7a-9b04-ffc25deaf432\" :answer/id #uuid \"c9c5e16a-fe3c-5a7a-9b04-ffc25deaf432\"] [:db/add \"c9c5e16a-fe3c-5a7a-9b04-ffc25deaf432\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c9c5e16a-fe3c-5a7a-9b04-ffc25deaf432\" :answer/value \"8\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"c9c5e16a-fe3c-5a7a-9b04-ffc25deaf432\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b01a33d3-e49a-58de-8a8f-1f7783630836\" :answer/id #uuid \"b01a33d3-e49a-58de-8a8f-1f7783630836\"] [:db/add \"b01a33d3-e49a-58de-8a8f-1f7783630836\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b01a33d3-e49a-58de-8a8f-1f7783630836\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"b01a33d3-e49a-58de-8a8f-1f7783630836\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"93d5b36f-fd95-59e6-942a-e49927311fc9\" :answer/id #uuid \"93d5b36f-fd95-59e6-942a-e49927311fc9\"] [:db/add \"93d5b36f-fd95-59e6-942a-e49927311fc9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"93d5b36f-fd95-59e6-942a-e49927311fc9\" :answer/value \"-4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"93d5b36f-fd95-59e6-942a-e49927311fc9\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\"] [:db/add \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\" :answer-field/choices \"17e8cc9b-2090-546f-b5f6-63612df70c02\"] [:db/add \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\" :answer-field/choices \"dc24f586-1089-577f-8c0e-7f39b8c84c5c\"] [:db/add \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\" :answer-field/choices \"c9c5e16a-fe3c-5a7a-9b04-ffc25deaf432\"] [:db/add \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\" :answer-field/choices \"b01a33d3-e49a-58de-8a8f-1f7783630836\"] [:db/add \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\" :answer-field/choices \"93d5b36f-fd95-59e6-942a-e49927311fc9\"] [:db/add \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\" :answer-field/correct \"dc24f586-1089-577f-8c0e-7f39b8c84c5c\"] [:db/ensure \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735\" :question/id #uuid \"062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735\"] [:db/add \"062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $4>0$, $|u|=4|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/4$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $16\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=4$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735\" :question/answer-fields \"70a32f43-6d04-5912-9359-a8d23281df9b\"] [:db/ensure \"062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"062650d4-1fa4-5f2c-84e7-e8520dfa7735\"] [:db/add \"752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77\" :answer/id #uuid \"752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77\"] [:db/add \"752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e84de875-40c5-5bdb-8a09-e48480956b35\" :answer/id #uuid \"e84de875-40c5-5bdb-8a09-e48480956b35\"] [:db/add \"e84de875-40c5-5bdb-8a09-e48480956b35\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e84de875-40c5-5bdb-8a09-e48480956b35\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"e84de875-40c5-5bdb-8a09-e48480956b35\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"78ca4bd8-5225-5b04-8a27-8d8cf24f20ad\" :answer/id #uuid \"78ca4bd8-5225-5b04-8a27-8d8cf24f20ad\"] [:db/add \"78ca4bd8-5225-5b04-8a27-8d8cf24f20ad\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"78ca4bd8-5225-5b04-8a27-8d8cf24f20ad\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"78ca4bd8-5225-5b04-8a27-8d8cf24f20ad\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"41296916-dadd-5bca-b6b4-0766d5545441\" :answer/id #uuid \"41296916-dadd-5bca-b6b4-0766d5545441\"] [:db/add \"41296916-dadd-5bca-b6b4-0766d5545441\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"41296916-dadd-5bca-b6b4-0766d5545441\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"41296916-dadd-5bca-b6b4-0766d5545441\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"98955048-7c21-56c7-bf34-29aea44f1171\" :answer/id #uuid \"98955048-7c21-56c7-bf34-29aea44f1171\"] [:db/add \"98955048-7c21-56c7-bf34-29aea44f1171\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"98955048-7c21-56c7-bf34-29aea44f1171\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"98955048-7c21-56c7-bf34-29aea44f1171\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\"] [:db/add \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\" :answer-field/choices \"752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77\"] [:db/add \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\" :answer-field/choices \"e84de875-40c5-5bdb-8a09-e48480956b35\"] [:db/add \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\" :answer-field/choices \"78ca4bd8-5225-5b04-8a27-8d8cf24f20ad\"] [:db/add \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\" :answer-field/choices \"41296916-dadd-5bca-b6b4-0766d5545441\"] [:db/add \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\" :answer-field/choices \"98955048-7c21-56c7-bf34-29aea44f1171\"] [:db/add \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\" :answer-field/correct \"752db311-1066-5745-828f-5ec327c1bf77\"] [:db/ensure \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9\" :question/id #uuid \"a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9\"] [:db/add \"a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $2>0$, $|u|=2|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/2$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9\" :question/answer-fields \"2838d84b-328c-5b8b-bbf8-043a80c2dbeb\"] [:db/ensure \"a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"a18b62e4-bd0f-5ad5-a4da-6ae883771ad9\"] [:db/add \"3ce6bf5b-cf0f-5180-b4bf-631b1a709785\" :answer/id #uuid \"3ce6bf5b-cf0f-5180-b4bf-631b1a709785\"] [:db/add \"3ce6bf5b-cf0f-5180-b4bf-631b1a709785\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"3ce6bf5b-cf0f-5180-b4bf-631b1a709785\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"3ce6bf5b-cf0f-5180-b4bf-631b1a709785\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d0da665b-b83b-5950-a555-b72bb07169c9\" :answer/id #uuid \"d0da665b-b83b-5950-a555-b72bb07169c9\"] [:db/add \"d0da665b-b83b-5950-a555-b72bb07169c9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d0da665b-b83b-5950-a555-b72bb07169c9\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"d0da665b-b83b-5950-a555-b72bb07169c9\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bce79f81-d030-503c-a803-5412bb4059cc\" :answer/id #uuid \"bce79f81-d030-503c-a803-5412bb4059cc\"] [:db/add \"bce79f81-d030-503c-a803-5412bb4059cc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bce79f81-d030-503c-a803-5412bb4059cc\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"bce79f81-d030-503c-a803-5412bb4059cc\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"cc2c6c38-3869-5854-bef0-07369ed45e1a\" :answer/id #uuid \"cc2c6c38-3869-5854-bef0-07369ed45e1a\"] [:db/add \"cc2c6c38-3869-5854-bef0-07369ed45e1a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"cc2c6c38-3869-5854-bef0-07369ed45e1a\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"cc2c6c38-3869-5854-bef0-07369ed45e1a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c943b728-62d2-511e-a97a-4a0493bfe0ae\" :answer/id #uuid \"c943b728-62d2-511e-a97a-4a0493bfe0ae\"] [:db/add \"c943b728-62d2-511e-a97a-4a0493bfe0ae\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c943b728-62d2-511e-a97a-4a0493bfe0ae\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"c943b728-62d2-511e-a97a-4a0493bfe0ae\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\"] [:db/add \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\" :answer-field/choices \"3ce6bf5b-cf0f-5180-b4bf-631b1a709785\"] [:db/add \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\" :answer-field/choices \"d0da665b-b83b-5950-a555-b72bb07169c9\"] [:db/add \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\" :answer-field/choices \"bce79f81-d030-503c-a803-5412bb4059cc\"] [:db/add \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\" :answer-field/choices \"cc2c6c38-3869-5854-bef0-07369ed45e1a\"] [:db/add \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\" :answer-field/choices \"c943b728-62d2-511e-a97a-4a0493bfe0ae\"] [:db/add \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\" :answer-field/correct \"cc2c6c38-3869-5854-bef0-07369ed45e1a\"] [:db/ensure \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"40993577-26ec-5c2a-86d9-4cbecdb4a736\" :question/id #uuid \"40993577-26ec-5c2a-86d9-4cbecdb4a736\"] [:db/add \"40993577-26ec-5c2a-86d9-4cbecdb4a736\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"40993577-26ec-5c2a-86d9-4cbecdb4a736\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"40993577-26ec-5c2a-86d9-4cbecdb4a736\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"40993577-26ec-5c2a-86d9-4cbecdb4a736\" :question/answer-fields \"ca7ef265-9e84-5525-8060-360e20887c13\"] [:db/ensure \"40993577-26ec-5c2a-86d9-4cbecdb4a736\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"40993577-26ec-5c2a-86d9-4cbecdb4a736\"] [:db/add \"47e15b9f-f50c-567d-a1f5-f944fe687c5d\" :answer/id #uuid \"47e15b9f-f50c-567d-a1f5-f944fe687c5d\"] [:db/add \"47e15b9f-f50c-567d-a1f5-f944fe687c5d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"47e15b9f-f50c-567d-a1f5-f944fe687c5d\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"47e15b9f-f50c-567d-a1f5-f944fe687c5d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a731f87b-217d-5532-bca4-d095f70ce817\" :answer/id #uuid \"a731f87b-217d-5532-bca4-d095f70ce817\"] [:db/add \"a731f87b-217d-5532-bca4-d095f70ce817\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"a731f87b-217d-5532-bca4-d095f70ce817\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"a731f87b-217d-5532-bca4-d095f70ce817\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"252218ad-1c4a-5fdb-acf3-685f2dad3a6e\" :answer/id #uuid \"252218ad-1c4a-5fdb-acf3-685f2dad3a6e\"] [:db/add \"252218ad-1c4a-5fdb-acf3-685f2dad3a6e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"252218ad-1c4a-5fdb-acf3-685f2dad3a6e\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"252218ad-1c4a-5fdb-acf3-685f2dad3a6e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"eab7f8bb-b962-515d-ae13-5b90b484af60\" :answer/id #uuid \"eab7f8bb-b962-515d-ae13-5b90b484af60\"] [:db/add \"eab7f8bb-b962-515d-ae13-5b90b484af60\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"eab7f8bb-b962-515d-ae13-5b90b484af60\" :answer/value \"-3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"eab7f8bb-b962-515d-ae13-5b90b484af60\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"75324eed-948f-5ad8-9539-9da66354e951\" :answer/id #uuid \"75324eed-948f-5ad8-9539-9da66354e951\"] [:db/add \"75324eed-948f-5ad8-9539-9da66354e951\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"75324eed-948f-5ad8-9539-9da66354e951\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"75324eed-948f-5ad8-9539-9da66354e951\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\"] [:db/add \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\" :answer-field/choices \"47e15b9f-f50c-567d-a1f5-f944fe687c5d\"] [:db/add \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\" :answer-field/choices \"a731f87b-217d-5532-bca4-d095f70ce817\"] [:db/add \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\" :answer-field/choices \"252218ad-1c4a-5fdb-acf3-685f2dad3a6e\"] [:db/add \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\" :answer-field/choices \"eab7f8bb-b962-515d-ae13-5b90b484af60\"] [:db/add \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\" :answer-field/choices \"75324eed-948f-5ad8-9539-9da66354e951\"] [:db/add \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\" :answer-field/correct \"47e15b9f-f50c-567d-a1f5-f944fe687c5d\"] [:db/ensure \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61\" :question/id #uuid \"b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61\"] [:db/add \"b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $5>0$, $|u|=5|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/5$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $15\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=3$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61\" :question/answer-fields \"c369d541-d031-5b92-b58f-6c2a22c6752d\"] [:db/ensure \"b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"b663b9ed-8aa3-50e4-9703-f86bb3d5df61\"] [:db/add \"61b30356-4581-5a04-8e9e-e9f024e0634f\" :answer/id #uuid \"61b30356-4581-5a04-8e9e-e9f024e0634f\"] [:db/add \"61b30356-4581-5a04-8e9e-e9f024e0634f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"61b30356-4581-5a04-8e9e-e9f024e0634f\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"61b30356-4581-5a04-8e9e-e9f024e0634f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"61691232-1c0b-5613-ba64-028cfeb6e4c5\" :answer/id #uuid \"61691232-1c0b-5613-ba64-028cfeb6e4c5\"] [:db/add \"61691232-1c0b-5613-ba64-028cfeb6e4c5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"61691232-1c0b-5613-ba64-028cfeb6e4c5\" :answer/value \"8\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"61691232-1c0b-5613-ba64-028cfeb6e4c5\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b29f38ea-83ae-5fe9-b85c-022cd5e0b555\" :answer/id #uuid \"b29f38ea-83ae-5fe9-b85c-022cd5e0b555\"] [:db/add \"b29f38ea-83ae-5fe9-b85c-022cd5e0b555\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b29f38ea-83ae-5fe9-b85c-022cd5e0b555\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"b29f38ea-83ae-5fe9-b85c-022cd5e0b555\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"efbbcdac-6022-538c-b9c9-08cbc5bab89b\" :answer/id #uuid \"efbbcdac-6022-538c-b9c9-08cbc5bab89b\"] [:db/add \"efbbcdac-6022-538c-b9c9-08cbc5bab89b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"efbbcdac-6022-538c-b9c9-08cbc5bab89b\" :answer/value \"-4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"efbbcdac-6022-538c-b9c9-08cbc5bab89b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"23ae40c8-dc38-59a6-bf33-5dcd76ff572b\" :answer/id #uuid \"23ae40c8-dc38-59a6-bf33-5dcd76ff572b\"] [:db/add \"23ae40c8-dc38-59a6-bf33-5dcd76ff572b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"23ae40c8-dc38-59a6-bf33-5dcd76ff572b\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"23ae40c8-dc38-59a6-bf33-5dcd76ff572b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\"] [:db/add \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\" :answer-field/choices \"61b30356-4581-5a04-8e9e-e9f024e0634f\"] [:db/add \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\" :answer-field/choices \"61691232-1c0b-5613-ba64-028cfeb6e4c5\"] [:db/add \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\" :answer-field/choices \"b29f38ea-83ae-5fe9-b85c-022cd5e0b555\"] [:db/add \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\" :answer-field/choices \"efbbcdac-6022-538c-b9c9-08cbc5bab89b\"] [:db/add \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\" :answer-field/choices \"23ae40c8-dc38-59a6-bf33-5dcd76ff572b\"] [:db/add \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\" :answer-field/correct \"b29f38ea-83ae-5fe9-b85c-022cd5e0b555\"] [:db/ensure \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"e0ca915f-85de-5d80-bc7b-4f29aece6b54\" :question/id #uuid \"e0ca915f-85de-5d80-bc7b-4f29aece6b54\"] [:db/add \"e0ca915f-85de-5d80-bc7b-4f29aece6b54\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"e0ca915f-85de-5d80-bc7b-4f29aece6b54\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $12\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=4$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"e0ca915f-85de-5d80-bc7b-4f29aece6b54\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"e0ca915f-85de-5d80-bc7b-4f29aece6b54\" :question/answer-fields \"4e83d6e8-b921-5001-9022-b4bf4f708392\"] [:db/ensure \"e0ca915f-85de-5d80-bc7b-4f29aece6b54\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"e0ca915f-85de-5d80-bc7b-4f29aece6b54\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"81715594-f2a8-545e-be47-73da10178012\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/05/0599fdcb3992b68a8349452a729dc6f86888dab8bf8590d92c455eec38d3bfdc/generator.py\"] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"] [:db/ensure 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/validate]] \"assertions\" [[\"f1b16480-9c36-50f9-807e-8bef4c87f22a\" :answer/id #uuid \"f1b16480-9c36-50f9-807e-8bef4c87f22a\"] [\"f1b16480-9c36-50f9-807e-8bef4c87f22a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f1b16480-9c36-50f9-807e-8bef4c87f22a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"9292dbeb-04c1-5a32-825d-48db9072d490\" :answer/id #uuid \"9292dbeb-04c1-5a32-825d-48db9072d490\"] [\"9292dbeb-04c1-5a32-825d-48db9072d490\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9292dbeb-04c1-5a32-825d-48db9072d490\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\" :answer/id #uuid \"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\"] [\"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"5cf0f831-44b4-5b73-a24c-dd7052978071\" :answer/id #uuid \"5cf0f831-44b4-5b73-a24c-dd7052978071\"] [\"5cf0f831-44b4-5b73-a24c-dd7052978071\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5cf0f831-44b4-5b73-a24c-dd7052978071\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{8}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"44e17a93-4b68-5f97-8d11-f86308e07ed7\" :answer/id #uuid \"44e17a93-4b68-5f97-8d11-f86308e07ed7\"] [\"44e17a93-4b68-5f97-8d11-f86308e07ed7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"44e17a93-4b68-5f97-8d11-f86308e07ed7\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\"] [\"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/choices \"f1b16480-9c36-50f9-807e-8bef4c87f22a\"] [\"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/choices \"9292dbeb-04c1-5a32-825d-48db9072d490\"] [\"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/choices \"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\"] [\"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/choices \"5cf0f831-44b4-5b73-a24c-dd7052978071\"] [\"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/choices \"44e17a93-4b68-5f97-8d11-f86308e07ed7\"] [\"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\" :answer-field/correct \"b38d76bb-3a13-5edd-b277-e294d22f2520\"] [\"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\" :question/id #uuid \"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\"] [\"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{1}{4}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\" :question/answer-fields \"3db76bd0-786f-52f1-ae29-26420c6d4c60\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"129dd18f-6700-5ffb-9ca8-25a04326a78f\"] [\"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\" :answer/id #uuid \"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\"] [\"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"0858e303-d45b-544b-a82f-2b47d25c2485\" :answer/id #uuid \"0858e303-d45b-544b-a82f-2b47d25c2485\"] [\"0858e303-d45b-544b-a82f-2b47d25c2485\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0858e303-d45b-544b-a82f-2b47d25c2485\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"f9070c8e-98bb-537d-936c-b2fa536149cf\" :answer/id #uuid \"f9070c8e-98bb-537d-936c-b2fa536149cf\"] [\"f9070c8e-98bb-537d-936c-b2fa536149cf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f9070c8e-98bb-537d-936c-b2fa536149cf\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"76f48c92-d114-574e-949d-dfbbe632e2f7\" :answer/id #uuid \"76f48c92-d114-574e-949d-dfbbe632e2f7\"] [\"76f48c92-d114-574e-949d-dfbbe632e2f7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"76f48c92-d114-574e-949d-dfbbe632e2f7\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{8}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"b6a37988-d4d9-5cc3-8d7e-644229205fc3\" :answer/id #uuid \"b6a37988-d4d9-5cc3-8d7e-644229205fc3\"] [\"b6a37988-d4d9-5cc3-8d7e-644229205fc3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b6a37988-d4d9-5cc3-8d7e-644229205fc3\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\"] [\"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/choices \"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\"] [\"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/choices \"0858e303-d45b-544b-a82f-2b47d25c2485\"] [\"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/choices \"f9070c8e-98bb-537d-936c-b2fa536149cf\"] [\"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/choices \"76f48c92-d114-574e-949d-dfbbe632e2f7\"] [\"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/choices \"b6a37988-d4d9-5cc3-8d7e-644229205fc3\"] [\"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\" :answer-field/correct \"a979c3cc-5cec-59fa-9c86-1af8788026cf\"] [\"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\" :question/id #uuid \"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\"] [\"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{3}{4}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\" :question/answer-fields \"cf2b3d6b-da18-5e5b-884b-0d11d69182a3\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"c0a73bc4-4368-5161-9323-4a7cdf99addc\"] [\"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\" :answer/id #uuid \"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\"] [\"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\" :answer/value \"\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [\"f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7\" :answer/id #uuid \"f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7\"] [\"f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a\" :answer/id #uuid \"1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a\"] [\"1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"5ae0933c-6d68-5428-8481-eb90fd459bb4\" :answer/id #uuid \"5ae0933c-6d68-5428-8481-eb90fd459bb4\"] [\"5ae0933c-6d68-5428-8481-eb90fd459bb4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5ae0933c-6d68-5428-8481-eb90fd459bb4\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"d5aeb8b6-1c02-5992-a768-3a79b93fa593\" :answer/id #uuid \"d5aeb8b6-1c02-5992-a768-3a79b93fa593\"] [\"d5aeb8b6-1c02-5992-a768-3a79b93fa593\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d5aeb8b6-1c02-5992-a768-3a79b93fa593\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\"] [\"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/choices \"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\"] [\"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/choices \"f6567fff-8697-5993-8738-f48f20019ac7\"] [\"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/choices \"1cc8a31c-bd74-5d67-b8a7-9c5e1ca9932a\"] [\"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/choices \"5ae0933c-6d68-5428-8481-eb90fd459bb4\"] [\"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/choices \"d5aeb8b6-1c02-5992-a768-3a79b93fa593\"] [\"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\" :answer-field/correct \"2adadd25-d5e5-5ebd-bbc3-59c1cd49688f\"] [\"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\" :question/id #uuid \"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\"] [\"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [\"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\" :question/answer-fields \"f336a66b-25b0-55c1-93aa-4c6a2e4cd416\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"7d2ee89d-6c8a-53ca-bf9f-9ef7347384d0\"] [\"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\" :answer/id #uuid \"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\"] [\"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\" :answer/value \"\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [\"1e6cf756-f438-5468-b2ac-a1a776c0186b\" :answer/id #uuid \"1e6cf756-f438-5468-b2ac-a1a776c0186b\"] [\"1e6cf756-f438-5468-b2ac-a1a776c0186b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1e6cf756-f438-5468-b2ac-a1a776c0186b\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"fe63a10d-a712-51b7-9c53-b15089294653\" :answer/id #uuid \"fe63a10d-a712-51b7-9c53-b15089294653\"] [\"fe63a10d-a712-51b7-9c53-b15089294653\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"fe63a10d-a712-51b7-9c53-b15089294653\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"674b7b7c-6378-5abc-9d6c-fc9b19a1f412\" :answer/id #uuid \"674b7b7c-6378-5abc-9d6c-fc9b19a1f412\"] [\"674b7b7c-6378-5abc-9d6c-fc9b19a1f412\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"674b7b7c-6378-5abc-9d6c-fc9b19a1f412\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"3e474cd7-7f34-5a64-bab1-3c3a2b0f75b8\" :answer/id #uuid \"3e474cd7-7f34-5a64-bab1-3c3a2b0f75b8\"] [\"3e474cd7-7f34-5a64-bab1-3c3a2b0f75b8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3e474cd7-7f34-5a64-bab1-3c3a2b0f75b8\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\"] [\"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/choices \"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\"] [\"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/choices \"1e6cf756-f438-5468-b2ac-a1a776c0186b\"] [\"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/choices \"fe63a10d-a712-51b7-9c53-b15089294653\"] [\"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/choices \"674b7b7c-6378-5abc-9d6c-fc9b19a1f412\"] [\"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/choices \"3e474cd7-7f34-5a64-bab1-3c3a2b0f75b8\"] [\"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\" :answer-field/correct \"2edf2af8-329a-558f-9a49-44d53d51089a\"] [\"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\" :question/id #uuid \"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\"] [\"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [\"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\" :question/answer-fields \"01af17da-f496-51ca-bfbc-212a3fe55113\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"cc70bb19-41c8-5bc7-bc7b-7067838806aa\"] [\"0cfa16d4-5631-5ba3-934a-4410fa770adc\" :answer/id #uuid \"0cfa16d4-5631-5ba3-934a-4410fa770adc\"] [\"0cfa16d4-5631-5ba3-934a-4410fa770adc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0cfa16d4-5631-5ba3-934a-4410fa770adc\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"482a3659-7a22-5e4c-8b9a-2a39a7fc8886\" :answer/id #uuid \"482a3659-7a22-5e4c-8b9a-2a39a7fc8886\"] [\"482a3659-7a22-5e4c-8b9a-2a39a7fc8886\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"482a3659-7a22-5e4c-8b9a-2a39a7fc8886\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"fbcd31a5-5b5e-57da-8f89-9460b07dd7d5\" :answer/id #uuid \"fbcd31a5-5b5e-57da-8f89-9460b07dd7d5\"] [\"fbcd31a5-5b5e-57da-8f89-9460b07dd7d5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"fbcd31a5-5b5e-57da-8f89-9460b07dd7d5\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"f16dfa66-8c67-52e6-a66a-7a95a8924434\" :answer/id #uuid \"f16dfa66-8c67-52e6-a66a-7a95a8924434\"] [\"f16dfa66-8c67-52e6-a66a-7a95a8924434\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f16dfa66-8c67-52e6-a66a-7a95a8924434\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{12}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\" :answer/id #uuid \"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\"] [\"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\"] [\"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/choices \"0cfa16d4-5631-5ba3-934a-4410fa770adc\"] [\"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/choices \"482a3659-7a22-5e4c-8b9a-2a39a7fc8886\"] [\"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/choices \"fbcd31a5-5b5e-57da-8f89-9460b07dd7d5\"] [\"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/choices \"f16dfa66-8c67-52e6-a66a-7a95a8924434\"] [\"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/choices \"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\"] [\"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\" :answer-field/correct \"bee12273-2a83-5105-b4c7-86e2a206049b\"] [\"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\" :question/id #uuid \"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\"] [\"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{4}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\" :question/answer-fields \"a1e2a447-4272-5a1e-a954-82d13a7c6622\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"e3061ebb-f317-5736-bf9c-2f1ab8d1fb2b\"] [\"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\" :answer/id #uuid \"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\"] [\"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"5562ca8a-35d2-531a-8583-831dbb8b4782\" :answer/id #uuid \"5562ca8a-35d2-531a-8583-831dbb8b4782\"] [\"5562ca8a-35d2-531a-8583-831dbb8b4782\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5562ca8a-35d2-531a-8583-831dbb8b4782\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"49bceb23-39fc-5501-8de2-bae684444332\" :answer/id #uuid \"49bceb23-39fc-5501-8de2-bae684444332\"] [\"49bceb23-39fc-5501-8de2-bae684444332\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"49bceb23-39fc-5501-8de2-bae684444332\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"5452d27c-098b-5d42-9957-4a9b29ed171c\" :answer/id #uuid \"5452d27c-098b-5d42-9957-4a9b29ed171c\"] [\"5452d27c-098b-5d42-9957-4a9b29ed171c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5452d27c-098b-5d42-9957-4a9b29ed171c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"f804bd82-51d1-5855-8258-16ab61cd35c4\" :answer/id #uuid \"f804bd82-51d1-5855-8258-16ab61cd35c4\"] [\"f804bd82-51d1-5855-8258-16ab61cd35c4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f804bd82-51d1-5855-8258-16ab61cd35c4\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\"] [\"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/choices \"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\"] [\"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/choices \"5562ca8a-35d2-531a-8583-831dbb8b4782\"] [\"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/choices \"49bceb23-39fc-5501-8de2-bae684444332\"] [\"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/choices \"5452d27c-098b-5d42-9957-4a9b29ed171c\"] [\"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/choices \"f804bd82-51d1-5855-8258-16ab61cd35c4\"] [\"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\" :answer-field/correct \"d4751077-0a7e-5a34-ba09-0f8a920a221c\"] [\"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\" :question/id #uuid \"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\"] [\"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{2}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\" :question/answer-fields \"6c4324ae-8174-549e-97e3-083fce1aac61\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"4fd16f91-5d8a-57c8-9912-b9ef2cf158ea\"] [\"d0aaf219-cc1f-5535-8fd4-5d943078d5b9\" :answer/id #uuid \"d0aaf219-cc1f-5535-8fd4-5d943078d5b9\"] [\"d0aaf219-cc1f-5535-8fd4-5d943078d5b9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d0aaf219-cc1f-5535-8fd4-5d943078d5b9\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"23f84d1d-f503-59bc-99f2-653086abbd50\" :answer/id #uuid \"23f84d1d-f503-59bc-99f2-653086abbd50\"] [\"23f84d1d-f503-59bc-99f2-653086abbd50\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"23f84d1d-f503-59bc-99f2-653086abbd50\" :answer/value \"\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [\"5616b423-4249-5fab-90b8-d2c73b2c6e24\" :answer/id #uuid \"5616b423-4249-5fab-90b8-d2c73b2c6e24\"] [\"5616b423-4249-5fab-90b8-d2c73b2c6e24\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5616b423-4249-5fab-90b8-d2c73b2c6e24\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"7f83b197-1529-5e99-b04a-707f0a67cb4a\" :answer/id #uuid \"7f83b197-1529-5e99-b04a-707f0a67cb4a\"] [\"7f83b197-1529-5e99-b04a-707f0a67cb4a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7f83b197-1529-5e99-b04a-707f0a67cb4a\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\" :answer/id #uuid \"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\"] [\"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\"] [\"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/choices \"d0aaf219-cc1f-5535-8fd4-5d943078d5b9\"] [\"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/choices \"23f84d1d-f503-59bc-99f2-653086abbd50\"] [\"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/choices \"5616b423-4249-5fab-90b8-d2c73b2c6e24\"] [\"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/choices \"7f83b197-1529-5e99-b04a-707f0a67cb4a\"] [\"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/choices \"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\"] [\"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\" :answer-field/correct \"0c1ac374-c413-5ca4-9f1f-661629c2c5ca\"] [\"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\" :question/id #uuid \"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\"] [\"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=2$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\" :question/answer-fields \"a58d8e6b-747b-566c-b93f-043f949d5404\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"c4638d6c-303b-5cb5-b68d-3da8c48514be\"] [\"21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3\" :answer/id #uuid \"21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3\"] [\"21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23\" :answer/id #uuid \"94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23\"] [\"94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc\" :answer/id #uuid \"88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc\"] [\"88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{10}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"a2644a79-8d95-5309-ba22-62887c805494\" :answer/id #uuid \"a2644a79-8d95-5309-ba22-62887c805494\"] [\"a2644a79-8d95-5309-ba22-62887c805494\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a2644a79-8d95-5309-ba22-62887c805494\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\" :answer/id #uuid \"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\"] [\"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\"] [\"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/choices \"21106588-e506-5e45-b746-8470cc41d3d3\"] [\"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/choices \"94e86255-c299-5518-ba2c-4269426f2a23\"] [\"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/choices \"88b1adb7-c539-5b17-94fb-7c98350ca7bc\"] [\"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/choices \"a2644a79-8d95-5309-ba22-62887c805494\"] [\"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/choices \"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\"] [\"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\" :answer-field/correct \"10dd7ff4-4d3d-5299-aa4f-53b2c52090f6\"] [\"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\" :question/id #uuid \"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\"] [\"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{1}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\" :question/answer-fields \"d4272cb6-e3f1-54ab-83c8-24c8e6312246\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"79fd25dc-fe7a-5e6d-9af8-52074c40dff4\"] [\"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\" :answer/id #uuid \"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\"] [\"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346\" :answer/id #uuid \"b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346\"] [\"b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"5fe273df-1eda-5c72-9f41-fe06a6624c7a\" :answer/id #uuid \"5fe273df-1eda-5c72-9f41-fe06a6624c7a\"] [\"5fe273df-1eda-5c72-9f41-fe06a6624c7a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5fe273df-1eda-5c72-9f41-fe06a6624c7a\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"5f66405d-f8fd-5913-9c55-7a2a881e0f3c\" :answer/id #uuid \"5f66405d-f8fd-5913-9c55-7a2a881e0f3c\"] [\"5f66405d-f8fd-5913-9c55-7a2a881e0f3c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5f66405d-f8fd-5913-9c55-7a2a881e0f3c\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"bb86e264-e9b1-5a13-bdad-5916b0ae8452\" :answer/id #uuid \"bb86e264-e9b1-5a13-bdad-5916b0ae8452\"] [\"bb86e264-e9b1-5a13-bdad-5916b0ae8452\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bb86e264-e9b1-5a13-bdad-5916b0ae8452\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\"] [\"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/choices \"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\"] [\"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/choices \"b1dd7846-263d-5ecc-9848-7ddcd4fec346\"] [\"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/choices \"5fe273df-1eda-5c72-9f41-fe06a6624c7a\"] [\"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/choices \"5f66405d-f8fd-5913-9c55-7a2a881e0f3c\"] [\"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/choices \"bb86e264-e9b1-5a13-bdad-5916b0ae8452\"] [\"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\" :answer-field/correct \"8739ebb0-2e91-578e-934b-e2ab9dcce44b\"] [\"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\" :question/id #uuid \"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\"] [\"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\" :question/answer-fields \"05742652-f2f3-5e0c-9369-fff85f913bff\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"c517ee8b-2398-5c31-9dd5-72e74530ca24\"] [\"35a499f0-74ec-58b5-9289-81cd6de2ed8b\" :answer/id #uuid \"35a499f0-74ec-58b5-9289-81cd6de2ed8b\"] [\"35a499f0-74ec-58b5-9289-81cd6de2ed8b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"35a499f0-74ec-58b5-9289-81cd6de2ed8b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"5b37ef5c-0a54-50f9-8929-55db42f1cf0b\" :answer/id #uuid \"5b37ef5c-0a54-50f9-8929-55db42f1cf0b\"] [\"5b37ef5c-0a54-50f9-8929-55db42f1cf0b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5b37ef5c-0a54-50f9-8929-55db42f1cf0b\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"06b6f683-62bf-5a71-a0bf-5f5d78b13621\" :answer/id #uuid \"06b6f683-62bf-5a71-a0bf-5f5d78b13621\"] [\"06b6f683-62bf-5a71-a0bf-5f5d78b13621\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"06b6f683-62bf-5a71-a0bf-5f5d78b13621\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\" :answer/id #uuid \"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\"] [\"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"fb47295e-82b8-5ceb-8a04-f8c683d541af\" :answer/id #uuid \"fb47295e-82b8-5ceb-8a04-f8c683d541af\"] [\"fb47295e-82b8-5ceb-8a04-f8c683d541af\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"fb47295e-82b8-5ceb-8a04-f8c683d541af\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\"] [\"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/choices \"35a499f0-74ec-58b5-9289-81cd6de2ed8b\"] [\"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/choices \"5b37ef5c-0a54-50f9-8929-55db42f1cf0b\"] [\"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/choices \"06b6f683-62bf-5a71-a0bf-5f5d78b13621\"] [\"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/choices \"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\"] [\"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/choices \"fb47295e-82b8-5ceb-8a04-f8c683d541af\"] [\"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\" :answer-field/correct \"24beca5b-1bbc-564b-9111-b57262bf1a93\"] [\"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\" :question/id #uuid \"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\"] [\"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{4}{3}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\" :question/answer-fields \"6fb2c974-04f6-5efb-b7dc-3b38c233fb1b\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"81ad82b8-f4e0-58fa-accc-ffa4bebb139c\"] [\"5ddf65e8-eb2f-53be-ae83-c354ca054f8d\" :answer/id #uuid \"5ddf65e8-eb2f-53be-ae83-c354ca054f8d\"] [\"5ddf65e8-eb2f-53be-ae83-c354ca054f8d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5ddf65e8-eb2f-53be-ae83-c354ca054f8d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"97ad9c8e-c2ce-5cb3-8b19-7f98b2f70e4d\" :answer/id #uuid \"97ad9c8e-c2ce-5cb3-8b19-7f98b2f70e4d\"] [\"97ad9c8e-c2ce-5cb3-8b19-7f98b2f70e4d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"97ad9c8e-c2ce-5cb3-8b19-7f98b2f70e4d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"c4ad03ca-167e-50ec-870b-d6819e0e5125\" :answer/id #uuid \"c4ad03ca-167e-50ec-870b-d6819e0e5125\"] [\"c4ad03ca-167e-50ec-870b-d6819e0e5125\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c4ad03ca-167e-50ec-870b-d6819e0e5125\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"6967a641-edd3-5a74-b591-85d1ab4da76f\" :answer/id #uuid \"6967a641-edd3-5a74-b591-85d1ab4da76f\"] [\"6967a641-edd3-5a74-b591-85d1ab4da76f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6967a641-edd3-5a74-b591-85d1ab4da76f\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\" :answer/id #uuid \"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\"] [\"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\"] [\"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/choices \"5ddf65e8-eb2f-53be-ae83-c354ca054f8d\"] [\"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/choices \"97ad9c8e-c2ce-5cb3-8b19-7f98b2f70e4d\"] [\"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/choices \"c4ad03ca-167e-50ec-870b-d6819e0e5125\"] [\"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/choices \"6967a641-edd3-5a74-b591-85d1ab4da76f\"] [\"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/choices \"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\"] [\"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\" :answer-field/correct \"9e357565-9807-57f4-aab7-b7ef5b4f78bb\"] [\"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\" :question/id #uuid \"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\"] [\"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{4}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\" :question/answer-fields \"50cd4bf5-1aa1-5030-84b4-a8276fb8ef30\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"42e86bff-6aba-589f-8a54-c26a0ba84936\"] [\"b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57\" :answer/id #uuid \"b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57\"] [\"b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f\" :answer/id #uuid \"8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f\"] [\"8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"202b6e2e-f98c-5e7c-9e3a-d3c48dd60d36\" :answer/id #uuid \"202b6e2e-f98c-5e7c-9e3a-d3c48dd60d36\"] [\"202b6e2e-f98c-5e7c-9e3a-d3c48dd60d36\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"202b6e2e-f98c-5e7c-9e3a-d3c48dd60d36\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\" :answer/id #uuid \"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\"] [\"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"36f70c88-0ef6-5ca6-92e7-d158d89d5f26\" :answer/id #uuid \"36f70c88-0ef6-5ca6-92e7-d158d89d5f26\"] [\"36f70c88-0ef6-5ca6-92e7-d158d89d5f26\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"36f70c88-0ef6-5ca6-92e7-d158d89d5f26\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\"] [\"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/choices \"b2486e22-2554-5ff6-9d0b-18b86378bb57\"] [\"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/choices \"8906364d-7222-5f86-b3ac-bbec3a33409f\"] [\"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/choices \"202b6e2e-f98c-5e7c-9e3a-d3c48dd60d36\"] [\"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/choices \"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\"] [\"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/choices \"36f70c88-0ef6-5ca6-92e7-d158d89d5f26\"] [\"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\" :answer-field/correct \"d3a5cea4-702e-5fbb-950b-ef343585cf2a\"] [\"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\" :question/id #uuid \"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\"] [\"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\" :question/answer-fields \"24b9be2c-5011-5f61-a5a7-479d6e9385a7\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"9c5c181d-b844-5b7d-9b79-1dad2f014764\"] [\"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\" :answer/id #uuid \"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\"] [\"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"7aa9a9e2-e7ca-568f-8ff8-ed126c211b80\" :answer/id #uuid \"7aa9a9e2-e7ca-568f-8ff8-ed126c211b80\"] [\"7aa9a9e2-e7ca-568f-8ff8-ed126c211b80\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7aa9a9e2-e7ca-568f-8ff8-ed126c211b80\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"48e1bae3-16e7-5573-8ec1-32d48bb60bf6\" :answer/id #uuid \"48e1bae3-16e7-5573-8ec1-32d48bb60bf6\"] [\"48e1bae3-16e7-5573-8ec1-32d48bb60bf6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"48e1bae3-16e7-5573-8ec1-32d48bb60bf6\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"a256a3dc-a3b6-5a7c-b4c9-2b41b4a45257\" :answer/id #uuid \"a256a3dc-a3b6-5a7c-b4c9-2b41b4a45257\"] [\"a256a3dc-a3b6-5a7c-b4c9-2b41b4a45257\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a256a3dc-a3b6-5a7c-b4c9-2b41b4a45257\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"ce92345c-fccd-5f71-80c8-5f31cd57e8b6\" :answer/id #uuid \"ce92345c-fccd-5f71-80c8-5f31cd57e8b6\"] [\"ce92345c-fccd-5f71-80c8-5f31cd57e8b6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ce92345c-fccd-5f71-80c8-5f31cd57e8b6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\"] [\"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/choices \"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\"] [\"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/choices \"7aa9a9e2-e7ca-568f-8ff8-ed126c211b80\"] [\"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/choices \"48e1bae3-16e7-5573-8ec1-32d48bb60bf6\"] [\"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/choices \"a256a3dc-a3b6-5a7c-b4c9-2b41b4a45257\"] [\"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/choices \"ce92345c-fccd-5f71-80c8-5f31cd57e8b6\"] [\"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\" :answer-field/correct \"acaba63a-57d4-55fc-a498-65e838bc5d96\"] [\"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\" :question/id #uuid \"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\"] [\"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{1}{2}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\" :question/answer-fields \"bc353288-5fbe-520a-92d8-6ad2def9f414\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"69248dc5-2b73-53df-a95f-0df952ca5485\"] [\"e923fc12-9cee-5e6f-b8ea-abccf7941fef\" :answer/id #uuid \"e923fc12-9cee-5e6f-b8ea-abccf7941fef\"] [\"e923fc12-9cee-5e6f-b8ea-abccf7941fef\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"e923fc12-9cee-5e6f-b8ea-abccf7941fef\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"2c2e2a1a-3cd6-5c4c-aebd-51d8adce6fcd\" :answer/id #uuid \"2c2e2a1a-3cd6-5c4c-aebd-51d8adce6fcd\"] [\"2c2e2a1a-3cd6-5c4c-aebd-51d8adce6fcd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"2c2e2a1a-3cd6-5c4c-aebd-51d8adce6fcd\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"e740253a-8298-550f-879e-caa0ff00a294\" :answer/id #uuid \"e740253a-8298-550f-879e-caa0ff00a294\"] [\"e740253a-8298-550f-879e-caa0ff00a294\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"e740253a-8298-550f-879e-caa0ff00a294\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\oper